cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use STRATO, please cite it using these metadata."
title: "STRATO: Spherical TRISO Analysis and Transport Operations"
type: software
authors:
  - alias: weewzr
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-11-06
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/weewzr/STRATO"
abstract: >-
  STRATO models fission-product diffusion through the five layers of a
  TRISO coated fuel particle. It solves the multilayer spherical diffusion
  problem with a conservative finite-volume method and with an exact
  Sturm-Liouville eigenfunction expansion, and uses each to verify the other.
keywords:
  - nuclear engineering
  - TRISO fuel
  - fission product release
  - diffusion
  - finite volume
  - Sturm-Liouville
